  <item>
    <title>爱乐之城的房间：色彩闯进黯淡</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b44e51b810e066f9d0c31c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b44e51b810e066f9d0c31c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 18:08:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>久违的房间专题，这次浅浅聊一下爱乐之城</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltLuULQ5wjNV-GPLmj3XjRO13j7y.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>女主的家好似梦中一般</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqmokkzhvjjoaq3tCsJQcnK51mv5.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>洗完澡后如同入梦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgjKtBWbx02P2aZwZeS-Bm6YsHUj.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>顾影自怜后的灯光变幻</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsnoXc1Pt0IdYq3iLCMdXAxQL5pz.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>室友切入，但并没有削弱梦幻感</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lobMaWrSW-tNNhfcnwMpTB_vAvM6.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>浴室色彩的拼接</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkg2T86Cl0skEkfX7o-FMwJiBlSc.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>蓝色的走廊和红黄蓝姐妹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llpsFi14g0FlhKxu0ydiJ8QUmTwQ.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>米娅房间环视</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljSykSOVj05aRrTqDfWk4aS5xIAP.gif"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsl4jMm76Ituc38i1av_VLAIxho1.gif"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrLr5LOsy-58lwX934JfSYieVGaZ.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>此段可以理解为将女主的内心戏用歌舞呈现出来</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lv139yp4if_7h36nlczEtf9BTWbD.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>回字形的空间环绕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmjCyukkTSlX2EGBHiype_ddISSW.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>收回到蓝色长廊上</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrs-xAS6GruF9_korp5kGS8VQ4jO.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>红黄绿三姐妹先离开，留下忧郁的女主</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqCadptjjCPbWvlMsER0gFvCg3am.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>与之形成鲜明对比的是黯淡的男主房间</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loqE98p3NzAwk0cC8emt5kSs2ExK.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>混乱，没有收拾，连地毯都没有</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loTW3pZXHB-VJ7TE9cg8biMTh1hI.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>乱糟糟的房间折射出男主乱成一团的生活</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lioAENDbrYhDlf0lh1AggxsxwPiY.gif"></p><span></span><p><span>一坐在钢琴前，男主仿佛就能稳定下来</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liT5GcghZmeWzFxr0gD9JMqx_h_g.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>第二次呈现女主房间的镜头</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loavmUYwYIXJ7nfPS5Jc8OlQIAwW.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>两个人搬到一起时，打光也像是在梦里</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr9pWs2NXdFyLEaoS5oWPwiYQyHm.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>一切入现实，打光让房间黯淡</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln-xLhCAr7gkbwbcWyqJ2Snz0lvP.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>非常俗气的特写</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lobyJLsPTQfvgkbG5YIYmeZX1NDS.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>女主进入男主的家之后，房间也变得有情调起来</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/For4aPsEzUHet_4Dc_fyzFF7r2ps.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>女主搬家的镜头</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvGnAP3-WsI3npNx0m6IPTwymJUE.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>女主的梦想闯进男主的房间，两个梦想在打架</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnOT6528sCZ_j8muX_zhgnuxKXXS.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>男主的钢琴在房间的一侧，他也睡在床的角落</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61a34d439229d5f7b62c0707/luok74larGK9LmCnKD50olTFe9oh.m4a" length="40287742" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqsCzIenaJYF6sOJgu3Q-YBrv11E.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>与建筑大王聊短歌赛和鸟赛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699e53a2a22480add6f9fba3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699e53a2a22480add6f9fba3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Feb 2026 01:51:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:00:18</a> 办赛人找办赛人聊办赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">00:01:38</a> 为什么不办短歌赛了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">00:08:13</a> 尘埃落定之后为什么没有重启短歌赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">00:11:49</a> 以后还会办短歌赛吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">00:13:37</a> 当游戏编剧比搞建筑还累！？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">00:20:01</a> 不办短歌赛了是因为 Z 不再需要短歌赛了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">00:27:04</a> 办鸟赛对建筑大王来说就像过年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">00:28:44</a> 鸟赛一开始是怎么办起来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">00:31:22</a> 为什么鸟赛还在继续</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2051">00:34:11</a> Z 没有放弃做播客的原因是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2246">00:37:26</a> 短歌是学步车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2512">00:41:52</a> 短歌赛满足了 Z 对于创业的需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2852">00:47:32</a> 感到稳定才办赛 vs 办赛让人感到稳定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">00:55:10</a> 进了大型游戏公司的 Z 还出得来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3846">01:04:06</a> 鸟赛拿奖不可求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4023">01:07:03</a> 参赛人数不增长才是自然的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4287">01:11:27</a> 扩圈是需要专门去做的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4494">01:14:54</a> 鸟赛规模没变大的可能原因之二</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4704">01:18:24</a> 鸟赛规模没变大的可能原因之三</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4853">01:20:53</a> 鸟赛规模没变大的可能原因之四</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5364">01:29:24</a> 努力扩圈的努力不是 yoko 想的那种努力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5546">01:32:26</a> 俳句是从连歌来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5704">01:35:04</a> 芭蕉从没写过俳句</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6045">01:40:45</a> Z 将来想做像鸟赛或连歌一样的游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6186">01:43:06</a> 办赛焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6438">01:47:18</a> 以后的鸟赛还可以比什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>鸟赛参赛入口：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vVQjI6lk7p6Z11VoZNRjAw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vVQjI6lk7p6Z11VoZNRjAw"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtoESWlDghbjDoJI8t5APjoPz9HV.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61a34d439229d5f7b62c0707/lphGUcdjKYD9aIb8QYS-GDV-6IxX.m4a" length="109430341" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:52:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhtUBAcrQv4toGRMmlfSBUK1XGwt.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>豆的房间丨成为创作者的故事 vol.25</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699b11b9de29766da92aa83c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699b11b9de29766da92aa83c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Feb 2026 14:50:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期房间专题的嘉宾是豆老师！</span></p><span></span><p><span>豆瓣ID：acaleph</span></p><span></span><p><span>豆老师是一位旅居日本的创作者，曾经是一位童书绘本编辑，而现在在日本从事木雕创作，也会写作、画画。</span></p><span></span><p><span>前段时间豆老师在豆瓣偶然发了自己的新家照片，然后我就果断邀请她来聊一期房间专题。这是非常治愈的一期，让同为创作者的我感到了安慰，也增加了信心，分享给大家！</span></p><span></span><p><span>不止房间，还有一个创作者的前进历程。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqUpBmnv_4BHjODrBlp7uZCzh9Xm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhyIvPFpYAMIvhcxEo6rVbvUqvCl.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2NoYNQqKOgxMrAp8sUCyeg11Ws.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSlLj585N9-kmoGYq8W1Xv4NP99.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCpVlVHEmLEhB75AuF5fePwVH4q.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fius199-vmqfHL1HMGJiyefFnOHT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FizRb1wJjRgFhGdGSSb93pvSGEv0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuNU9RHnq1SGuGK95TtWP4ghIWNx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>空屋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi8ZOx2qLkeJS3_qe_MTiTUdeBs7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>录制现场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgzlzcHxgyZWPSjiRArPbxYUkGxx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>我的录制现场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frk4oumclIh7Fo_gGRrDGrBgAAZ_.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>豆老师的第一个木雕作品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhTMEUno3_crJhHCpA0Ta_QywMrl.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>豆老师的画（不透明水彩）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoBIb11iu7BN4nIvHJh1xpgGE2zk.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>可爱木雕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpMdkSJ40QFrBP4z_Wf8IkyziN_O.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>去年展览的海报，今年敬请期待</span></p>]]></description>
