    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a21958293471fed417ec91</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Aug 2025 18:23:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>黄垃圾协会的四位成员再次聚首，这一次是为了填上半年前挖的一次坑，继续聊一聊大家在各地旅行的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期你可以听到：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>俄罗斯见闻升级版：教堂、墓地和红场</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>仔细观察武装力量大教堂以至于差点冻死在莫斯科郊外的晚上</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>破败的雅典，老房子如粘在欧洲文明上的藤壶，见证迭起兴衰</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>对东京的刻板印象原来不是刻板印象：又压抑了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>两位嘉宾的故乡都是很值得一去的地方：新疆和广西</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhDWJp9mEF6aSUzuPnAiJjCKeiJe.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>武装力量大教堂耶稣像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi3hJSMluUzCfIOqk6Zk8Ga0ALx7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>夜景武装力量大教堂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn8azVTfb_e9O96xd_oQajdcaC9y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“胜利者的母亲”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loq62w0j_4V05jSGzOatPH0DOxle.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>武装力量大教堂屋顶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loHuY3gWzez71pQXpsh1CBGitWXc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这些标志背后的组织要真坐一屋估计要打起来</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lryDfbBWFccLreOB9Igk5W_Jh6Xh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>还是屋顶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgT-gugfJVW9MiyVACFFfHTHCECJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>重塑历史记忆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lq4c1SlAErgPJ5oM31ouOB_wMu8F.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>战争和宗教</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-8Cocv7dFR0bRa_ns7sBzg8vKP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>老人在武装力量大教堂检索自己家人的事迹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqZpNvGxBNmFn_xa9dmQcTwFvvPt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>浮雕里呈现的战争场面（一）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flc-AZKQ6Ne7ODsR0Xe3tjpfsSOf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>浮雕里呈现的战争场面（二）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltqfwHW24c8Z4Pj0kFhV4VV_DiOE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>建出来就是给你拍照的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrIJ6Y10QubaYA0Zz2C8HPFCr2vs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“胜利者的母亲”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu5hXbDONwGV3pPSdG98QDBIOTab.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>壁画细节</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnSc0SN-yRlZx-amSQzUBggiHiqB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>距离基辅710公里</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm8c44mkBH3sJZegWknp9d5KRfk1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>武装力量大教堂外的毛岸英像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJ5Wi7u2P2Ey7DTheTp80xkRhWk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>芥川同志贡献了手机截图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkEwS8v1SGBBIBoCE_CEKJCEn2z4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>公墓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lu_QP1IRLWmgEOG1iZSBUf-w93T8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llohsWs6ZdHvT2UYL6swVxfOuZ3O.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>古当大村屯</span></p>]]></description>
